  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022-24 Safeguarding children and vulnerable adults within Caritas Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Safeguarding of children and vulnerable adults is effectively practised by Caritas at different levels and has become a culture that has developed within the Africa Region
Outcome 2: Women and youth are included in Caritas governance bodies, programmes and projects at all levels.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this Project is to promote the Safeguarding of children and vulnerable adults while fostering the emergence of youth and women&apos;s leadership to serve better, accompany and defend their communities for an integral, inclusive and sustainable human development.</narrative>
